				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 08 May 2016 01:08:29 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Steeltitan</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1871133</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You know, I always had a soft spot for Olympia in my heart. The detail put into the creation of it, the feels mixed with both humor and science made it one of my favorite parts of site. So, um, now that the Resurrection hub is up and Alpha 9 is getting its members, when can we expect to see Olympia, since she was implied to be coming out of storage in <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/new-tricks">this tale?</a></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
