				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Reach</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1779895</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A living fossil sub-canon within the Site, then? I liked it, though, but I do understand why they never took off. So, points taken. Thank you for taking the time to answer, Aelanna.</p> 
